    <p>*Due to the competitive nature of the Physician Assistant Program, not all candidates will be offered an interview or admission into the Elizabethtown College PA Program.</p>
    <p>After the interview is conducted, the admissions committee will recommend one of the following based upon the collective judgment of the committee and a point scoring system.</p>
